{"src":"en","tgt":"id","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"id","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7707.551456,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":9003.690881,"text":"Jika Anda pernah menonton film National Treasure, Anda mungkin berpikir bahwa peta harta karun ditulis di bagian belakang Deklarasi Kemerdekaan."},{"kind":"audio","t":9248.087257000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9252.639784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9257.464107,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9262.563535000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9267.764092000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9273.065857000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9278.779896,"samples":31318,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"input","t":13870.177402000001,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14829.277824,"text":"Cokelat panasnya memenuhi standar Belgia. Jus buah memang mahal, tetapi setelah beberapa waktu, Anda akan bisa merasakan kemanisannya."},{"kind":"audio","t":14917.761997000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14922.653329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14923.171320000001,"samples":5795,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"audio","t":14995.63709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15001.041313000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15006.622614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15012.083086999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15014.232152,"samples":16049,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":22207.531174,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23303.216538,"text":"Namun, itu tidak benar. Meskipun ada sesuatu yang tertulis di bagian belakang dokumen tersebut, itu bukanlah peta harta karun."},{"kind":"audio","t":23375.852325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23376.593003,"samples":10421,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":23465.974292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":23470.920063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23476.04636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23481.138569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23485.075306000002,"samples":26637,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1100},{"kind":"input","t":29976.374679,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31362.424833,"text":"Anda juga mungkin ingin mempertimbangkan saran dari pemerintah lain selain pemerintah negara Anda sendiri, tetapi saran mereka dirancang untuk warga negara mereka."},{"kind":"audio","t":31599.32719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31600.867415000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31602.090406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31604.091824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31605.651659,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31607.178563999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31608.664950000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31609.166461999997,"samples":13040,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":41288.147619999996,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42310.172313999996,"text":"Pulau Hong Konglah yang memberikan nama pada wilayah Hong Kong, dan merupakan tempat yang dianggap oleh banyak turis sebagai destinasi utama."},{"kind":"audio","t":42490.457937,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42495.290139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42500.505266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42505.421536999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42510.446576999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42515.93543899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42517.710929999994,"samples":14043,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":49090.476699,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50620.652945999995,"text":"Siapa pun yang akan mengemudi di daerah beriklim panas atau melewati pegunungan sebaiknya mempertimbangkan kemungkinan adanya salju, es, atau kondisi jalan yang buruk."},{"kind":"audio","t":50826.112195999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50830.938708999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50836.345821999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50841.503009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50846.758395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50851.772665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50856.665787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50857.815528,"samples":16383,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":58776.137969999996,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59722.264858999995,"text":"Segregasi dan rekombinasi menyebabkan variasi berpindah-pindah antara kedua kelompok tersebut."},{"kind":"audio","t":59854.376962999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59859.260514999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59864.473141999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59869.56209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59872.224797999996,"samples":18278,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":61180.114534,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61420.233818999994,"text":"Setiap generasi."},{"kind":"audio","t":61463.542425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61463.959618999994,"samples":3733,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":66503.896733,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67359.36655400001,"text":"Istilah “bug” digunakan oleh para entomolog dalam arti formal untuk kelompok serangga ini."},{"kind":"audio","t":67485.863098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67490.72532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67495.82053900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67501.020245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67502.00111,"samples":9083,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":74688.018708,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75717.671879,"text":"Pertama, sebagian besar pengendara mengenakan sepatu berkuda dengan tumit dan sol yang halus serta cukup sempit."},{"kind":"audio","t":75856.111793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75861.116402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75866.413938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75872.07440700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75877.070787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75877.403992,"samples":3622,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":83905.40646700001,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84733.062523,"text":"Komisi tersebut merupakan respons Martelli terhadap protes anti-rezim yang marak terjadi sejak bulan Oktober."},{"kind":"audio","t":84883.16052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84888.070621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84893.182469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84899.720824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84904.802673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":84906.700413,"samples":13931,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":91128.070188,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":91939.19665900001,"text":"Tim pemadam kebakaran akhirnya berhasil memadamkan api pada pukul 23.35."},{"kind":"audio","t":92079.35411500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92084.263546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92089.870006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92095.034314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92099.911475,"samples":30260,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"input","t":97357.34440700001,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98108.957631,"text":"Badai yang menjadi bagian dari musim badai Atlantik, Badai Subtropis Jerry."},{"kind":"audio","t":98214.822126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98220.598633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98225.542484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98227.014041,"samples":12594,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":100222.189321,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100914.703382,"text":"Badai Subtropis Jerry terbentuk di Samudra Atlantik hari ini."},{"kind":"audio","t":101010.272221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101015.33918000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101020.48571800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101020.81238300001,"samples":3956,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":107229.151087,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107945.882689,"text":"Hal ini mendorong kita untuk melatih mobil dan berbagai perangkat transportasi lainnya."},{"kind":"audio","t":108066.438589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108071.540617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108076.762913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108082.197357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":108082.530751,"samples":1003,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":116603.973545,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117586.519361,"text":"Terkenal sebagai pusat kemewahan yang bermula sekitar tahun 400 Masehi dan berlangsung hingga..."},{"kind":"audio","t":117717.98882500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117722.82528800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117728.06910400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117733.474378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117735.765361,"samples":17442,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":120739.627309,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121263.390692,"text":"hingga sekitar tahun 1100 Masehi."},{"kind":"audio","t":121341.158597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121346.26268500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121347.60209300001,"samples":12204,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":127059.9057,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127600.005582,"text":"Permukaan bulan terbuat dari batu dan debu. Lapisan luar bulan disebut kerak."},{"kind":"audio","t":127703.911188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127708.825539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127709.172003,"samples":4123,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"audio","t":127714.91122200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127717.899904,"samples":21009,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"input","t":134204.187167,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135448.41523299998,"text":"Korps Insinyur Amerika Serikat memperkirakan bahwa curah hujan sebesar enam inci dapat merusak bagian yang sudah rusak sebelumnya."},{"kind":"audio","t":135620.91285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135625.743043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135631.94273399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135637.021162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135642.77876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135648.043676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135648.341731,"samples":2619,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":141174.998521,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142400.227591,"text":"Secara khusus, dikatakan bahwa seseorang dapat mendeteksi apakah seseorang berbohong dengan menafsirkan mikroekspresi dengan benar."},{"kind":"audio","t":142580.75568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142585.603992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142590.96662599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":142596.19061199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142601.592626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":142606.86671099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142607.323694,"samples":7634,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":147226.17778099998,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147985.00313,"text":"Jangan merusak situs ini dengan membuat coretan atau goresan grafiti pada bangunannya."},{"kind":"audio","t":148110.468871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148115.09040699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148120.343642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148125.697907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148126.07939099998,"samples":5461,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":154864.505606,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156219.31771099998,"text":"Gema raungan harimau tidak seperti raungan penuh suara singa, melainkan lebih menyerupai serangkaian kata-kata yang diteriakkan dengan marah."},{"kind":"audio","t":156397.405489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":156402.461908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156407.749794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156412.96326999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156418.57533999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156423.87867499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156424.344518,"samples":9027,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":161904.228397,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163113.61774,"text":"Penelitian abad ke-20 menunjukkan bahwa terdapat dua sumber variasi genetik, yaitu yang tersembunyi dan yang terungkap."},{"kind":"audio","t":163284.378056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163289.182289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163294.42921499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163299.93780699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163305.206412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163309.10202999998,"samples":25077,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"close","t":173404.95596199998,"code":1005}]}